 query produces no matching records, the table shows an empty state with a message indicating no results were found for the current filters and search\"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Requirement S8-R4: \"The empty state includes a prompt or link to clear filters and, where a search query is active, to clear the query\"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Requirement S8-R5: \"Where both a query and filters are active, each is cleared independently from the empty state. Clearing filters does not clear the query and clearing the query does not clear the filters, consistent with S13-R13\"."}]}]},"customfield_10252":null,"timetracking":{},"customfield_10015":null,"security":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/59324","id":"59324","filename":"screen-capture - 2026-08-05T123655.032.webm","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","accountId":"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","emailAddress":"bilal.muzamil@shopview.com","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png"},"displayName":"Bilal Muzamil","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Karachi","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-08-05T02:37:15.826-0500","size":1526166,"mimeTyp